## SECTION 4 — SERP ANALYSIS
**competitor_gaps** (demand-validated 2+ sources):
1. Which shape suits which pattern — confirmed gap. SHANGMENG and Joyee Nails both address "best shape per design" as a distinct decision layer; roundup competitors (Nail Buffet, Her Nail Club, AOL, Green Wedding Shoes) skip shape entirely and just caption Instagram photos.
2. Small-nail/short-nail pattern legibility — confirmed gap. SHANGMENG explicitly flags that fine grids and checkerboards become illegible at short-nail scale; no competitor roundup addresses which patterns survive at short length vs. which need long/wide surface area.
3. Occasion-matching depth — confirmed gap. Multiple competitors claim "works for any occasion" as a blanket, unsubstantiated line (BTArtbox, nailpin, Allure Edition) with zero breakdown of which specific pattern suits which specific occasion (office vs. wedding guest vs. night out).
4. Application/DIY technique specificity — confirmed gap. nailpin and Allure Edition gesture at "use a dotting tool" but no competitor gives pattern-by-pattern difficulty ranking or tool guidance.

**missing_semantic_territory:** skin tone pairing specificity (competitors claim "works with all skin tones" with zero elaboration), longevity/care guidance tied specifically to two-tone high-contrast polish (chip visibility on dark colour), nail shape recommendation matched to specific pattern type.

**our_strategic_approach:** Structure the roundup as a decision tool, not just a scroll gallery — group designs by pattern family, and for each attach the one differentiating detail (best shape, best nail length, best occasion) competitors omit. This turns a generic "photo dump" into the most decision-useful black and white roundup ranking, which is the exact complaint pattern showing up around "too many options, no signal for which one is yours" language already used successfully on other Mirellé posts.

**recommended_image_count_validation:** Confirmed compatible — inspirational idea roundups in this space typically run far higher image counts (all competitors show 15-46+ photos), but 7 total (session override) is workable as a curated "best of" selection rather than an exhaustive gallery; frontmatter/body pairing should prioritise the most visually distinct pattern families over volume.

